---

<Layout title="Farm" description="The farm rests on two kilometers of uninhabited coastline along lake Fryken.">
	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>The Farm</h1>
		<p>
			The farm rests on two kilometers of uninhabited coastline along lake Fryken and commands
			spectacular views of pastureland, the lake, and oxygen-rich forests, just south of Sunne.
		</p>
	</div>

	<section>
		<h2>Where to stay</h2>
		<div class="cards">
			<div class="card">
				<img src="/images/011_image-asset.webp" alt="The Farmhouse exterior" />
				<h3>Farmhouse</h3>
				<p>Staff provide attentive service while maintaining your privacy — meal catering, transportation, and guidance on foraging. A Welcome Book covers everything else.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<img src="/images/030_Living_room.webp" alt="The Old Wing living room" />
				<h3>The Old Wing</h3>
				<p>100 meters from the main house, for couples or small families. Full kitchen, wood and leather furnishings seating eight, antiques, and an integrated audio system.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Amenities</h2>
		<ul class="amenities">
			<li>Fully equipped kitchen (Moccamaster, Mikasa, Le Creuset)</li>
			<li>Fireplace</li>
			<li>Premium beds</li>
			<li>Sauna with indoor cold bath</li>
			<li>Gym — yoga mats, dumbbells</li>
			<li>WiFi throughout</li>
			<li>Jacuzzi</li>
			<li>Mini-bar</li>
		</ul>
		<div class="gallery wide">
			<img src="/images/027_ko_k1.webp" alt="Kitchen" />
			<img src="/images/043_ko_k2.webp" alt="Kitchen detail" />
			<img src="/images/031_dining_area.webp" alt="Dining area" />
			<img src="/images/046_jacuzzi.webp" alt="Jacuzzi" />
			<img src="/images/047_Office.webp" alt="Office" />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Floor plans</h2>
		<div class="floorplans">
			<img src="/images/038_Ground_Floor.webp" alt="Ground floor plan" />
			<img src="/images/035_Upper_Floor.webp" alt="Upper floor plan" />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Gallery</h2>
		<div class="gallery">
			{gallery.map((src) => (
				<img src={`/images/${src}`} alt="Öjerviks gård" loading="lazy" />
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<a class="cta" href="https://airbnb.com/h/ojervikfarmhouse" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book on Airbnb</a>
	</section>
</Layout>
